{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Master the Art of Soulslike Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/\uc18c\uc6b8\ub77c\uc774\ud06c_\uae30\ubcf8\uc5d0_\ucda9\uc2e4\ud55c_\uc804\ud22c_\uc640\uc774\ub4dc_.gif?t=1744949744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">V.E.D.A is a Soulslike game where you can train and learn the unique combat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not only those who enjoy Soulslike games, but also those who try for the first time can enjoy the thrilling achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through the rigorous training simulator, created by the super AI V.E.D.A, you can also experience the unique combined roguelike system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Humanity\u2019s Last Hope - The Super AI V.E.D.A</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supporting Agents With V.E.D.A\u2019s Motherhood</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/The-World-Has-Fallen-And-You-Are-Its-Last-Hope_\uc640\uc774\ub4dc_.gif?t=1744949744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the near future, global warming caused an unfathomable disaster to humankind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ancient virus destroyed 90% of humanity and now inhabited by bizarre mutated creatures with methane gas in the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The super intelligent AI V.E.D.A commenced the emergency training simulator to reclaim the surface, and you\u2019re the training agent!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you overcome V.E.D.A challenges and become the perfect agent?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But\u2026 What secrets are V.E.D.A hiding from you?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combat That Demands Precision and Mastery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep, Immersive Soulslike Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/Forge-Your-Own-Combat-Style-Adapt-to-the-Unknow_\uc640\uc774\ub4dc_.gif?t=1744949744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attack, dodge, and parry with pinpoint accuracy. Every encounter demands focus, strategy, and mastery of your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overclock \u2013 Unleash Devastation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/\ud544\uc0b4\uae30__\uc624\ubc84\ud074\ub7ed_\uc640\uc774\ub4dc_.gif?t=1744949744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charge your Overclock gauge and activate powerful, battle-turning abilities embedded in your weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Timing is everything\u2014strike at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bosses That Break You\u2014Or Make You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/\ud654\ub824\ud558\uace0_\ub2e4\ucc44\ub85c\uc6b4_\ubcf4\uc2a4_\uc804\ud22c_\uc640\uc774\ub4dc_.gif?t=1744949744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every trial culminates in a fierce boss battle that will test everything you\u2019ve learned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt, endure, and emerge victorious.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Forge Your Own Combat Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose Your Arsenal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/\ub79c\ub364\ud55c_\ubb34\uae30__\ubc29\ud328_\ud68d\ub4dd\uacfc_\ub2e4\uc591\ud55c_\uc870\ud569_\uc640\uc774\ub4dc_.gif?t=1744949744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield a variety of weapons, armor, and items to craft a playstyle that suits you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your rhythm, experiment with different loadouts, and dominate the battlefield your way.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Roguelike Training Program Like No Other</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Train, Adapt, Overcome</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/\ub79c\ub364\ud558\uac8c_\uc0dd\uc131\ub418\ub294_\ud658\uacbd\uacfc_\ub9f5_\uc640\uc774\ub4dc_.gif?t=1744949744\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the very end of the standard training, V.E.D.A will put you to the test to become the perfect combat agent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must survive in every procedurally generated maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize randomly placed items to finish the ultimate training.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Challenge Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The battlefield is calling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you rise to the challenge, master the art of combat, and uncover the truth behind <strong>V.E.D.A</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enter the simulator. Train, fight, and prove your worth.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2659980?t=1744949744","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2659980?t=1744949