 memory, undergoes combat training in a training simulator and uncovers hidden secrets. You too can enter the Soulslike genre. Don't hesitate.","steam_appid":2659980,"support_info":{"email":"johnny@tripearlgames.com","url":"https://www.tripearlgames.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Korean, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.tripearlgames.com/"}